{"resourceIdentifier":"1882","resourceName":"REDD+ PROJECT IN THE ALTO HUAYABAMBA CONSERVATION CONCESSION (CCAH)","description":"The REDD+ project in the Alto Huayabamba Concession Conservation (CCAH) is located in the region of San Martín in the central north of Peru. The CCAH covers an area of 143,928.09 ha at an altitude between 1800-4670 meters above sea level, with two well-defined ecosystems: a) the so-called Paramos of the central cordillera; and b) the so-called Peruvian Yungas or mountain forests. The area of the project is in the forest-covered zone of the CCAH and covers 53,410 ha, located in the Corridor of Conservation Abiseo-Cóndor-Kutukú, in the two countries of Ecuador and Peru; within the hotspot of the eastern mountains of the Tropical Andes and the Great Forest Area of the Amazon in the lower Andean-Amazonian areas.\r\n\r\nWithin the area of the project exists a total of 40 families, widespread and in two (2) settlements: Nuevo Bolívar and El Progreso, with 26 families in the latter two, who make use of and are dependent of the forest.\r\n\r\nThe area of the project has an exceptional value of the biodiversity, where 310 species amongst the amphibians, reptiles, birds, and mammals have been identified as objects of the conservation for the Peruvian Yungas (highest number of occurrence per area for the Peruvian Yungas for 52 species), the yellow-tailed woolly monkey (Oreonax flavicauda) being the flag species of the CCAH.\r\n\r\nThe general objective of the project is the conservation of the CCAH's montane forests to protect their exceptional biodiversity and the ecosystem services they provide, without undermining the opportunities to improve the living conditions of the population that depend on these forests. The conservation of the CCAH's forests will prevent the emission of 52,425 tCO2e per year.","location":{"latitude":-7.591101,"longitude":-77.412497},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-06-19","endExclusive":"2024-07-20","endInclusive":"2024-07-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1882"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mariscal Cáceres and Huallaga Provinces"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Asociacion Amazonicos por la Amazonía"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1882"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1882"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"53179"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":53981}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"53410 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31/07/2019"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 30/10/2013 - 29/10/2047"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Asociacion Amazonicos por la Amazonía"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested "}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"53179"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Reduced Emissions from Deforestation and Degradation"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"53410 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"strin